---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { site } from '../site';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Notice"
  description="How Skandava handles the details you send through the contact form: what we collect, why, who processes it and how to ask us to delete it."
>
  <PageHero title="Privacy notice." lead="What happens to the details you send us, in plain language." crumbs={[{ label: 'Privacy' }]} />
  <section class="container-x max-w-3xl pb-16">
    <div class="prose-site text-[1.1rem]">
      <p><em>Last updated: 20 September 2026.</em></p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>Only what you type into the contact form: your name, your email address, your phone number (optional) and your message. We do not ask for anything else.</p>

      <h2>Why we use it</h2>
      <p>To read your message and reply to you about your enquiry. We do not use it for anything unrelated and we do not sell it.</p>

      <h2>How it is sent and who handles it</h2>
      <p>When you press Send, the form sends your message to our server, which passes it to Resend, an email delivery service, so that it reaches our inbox. Resend and our email provider therefore process your message on our behalf and may keep delivery records.</p>

      <h2>Cookies and tracking</h2>
      {site.analytics.ga4 || site.analytics.plausibleDomain
        ? <p>We use {site.analytics.ga4 ? 'Google Analytics' : 'Plausible Analytics'} to count visits and see which pages and buttons are used, so we can improve the site. It does not identify you personally by name. We do not use advertising cookies.</p>
        : <p>This site does not currently use advertising cookies or analytics. If that changes we will update this notice before it does.</p>}

      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>We keep enquiry emails for as long as they are needed to deal with your request and to keep a reasonable record of the conversation.</p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>You can ask us what we hold about you, ask us to correct it, or ask us to delete it, by emailing <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about this notice: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
